# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# There was no .gitattributes and 78 tracked files mixed CRLF with LF. That is
# not cosmetic: a read-modify-write by any tool that opens files in text mode
# silently rewrites every line, so a three-line change arrives as a
# thousand-line diff and the real edit is impossible to review. It happened
# repeatedly, and it also hid a 43,562-line churn inside a submodule.
#
# LF in the repository, whatever the checkout platform. Shell scripts and
# Dockerfiles are consumed by Linux containers, so LF is also what they need at
# runtime.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these, and never try to diff them as text.
*.pdf   -text
*.png   -text
*.jpg   -text
*.jpeg  -text
*.gif   -text
*.ico   -text
*.webm  -text
*.zip   -text
*.gz    -text
*.woff  -text
*.woff2 -text
